---
name: freeze
version: 0.1.0
description: |
  把文件编辑限制在指定目录内。阻止对边界外文件的 Edit / Write。
  适用于调试、范围受限改动或希望只动单一模块的场景。 (gstack)
allowed-tools:
  - Bash
  - Read
  - AskUserQuestion
hooks:
  PreToolUse:
    - matcher: "Edit"
      hooks:
        - type: command
          command: "bash ${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/bin/check-freeze.sh"
          statusMessage: "Checking freeze boundary..."
    - matcher: "Write"
      hooks:
        - type: command
          command: "bash ${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/bin/check-freeze.sh"
          statusMessage: "Checking freeze boundary..."
sensitive: true
---
